  "Software Details": "تفاصيل البرامج",
  "The Consignment Module integration in Dash SaaS streamlines the creation and management of consignment agreements for businesses. Within the platform, users can easily generate customized consignment agreements tailored to their specific needs. These agreements can include detailed terms and conditions, pricing structures, commission rates, Tax calculation and inventory specifications. By providing a centralized platform for agreement creation, businesses can ensure consistency and accuracy across all their consignment partnerships, fostering stronger relationships with consignment partners and minimizing the risk of disputes.": "يعمل تكامل وحدة الشحن في Dash SaaS على تبسيط إنشاء وإدارة اتفاقيات الشحن للشركات. ",
  "/Month": "/شهر",
  "/Year": "/سنة",
  "Buy Now": "اشتري الآن",
  "View Live Demo": "عرض تجريبي مباشر",
  "Efficient ": "فعال ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " تتبع المخزون ",
  " and Management": " والإدارة",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "باستخدام وحدة الشحن، يمكن للشركات تتبع وإدارة المخزون المرسل بكفاءة داخل Dash SaaS. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "عرض وتسعير المنتجات في شحنة",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "تتيح وحدة العمولة للمستخدمين عرض قائمة شاملة بالمنتجات الموجودة في الشحنة، مما يضمن الرؤية الكاملة للمخزون. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "إنشاء وتحويل أوامر الشراء",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "في وحدة العمولة، يمكن للمستخدمين إنشاء أوامر شراء مفصلة وتحويل هذه الأوامر بسهولة إلى عمليات شراء فعلية. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "إنشاء وتحويل أوامر البيع",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "تدعم وحدة العمولة أيضًا إنشاء أوامر البيع، والتي يمكن تحويلها بسهولة إلى مبيعات نهائية. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "لماذا تختار وحدات مخصصة",
  "for your business?": "لعملك؟",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "باستخدام Dash، يمكنك إدارة جميع وظائف عملك بسهولة من مكان واحد",
  "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "قم بتمكين القوى العاملة لديك باستخدام DASH",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Accounting, HR, Payments, Leads, Communication, Management, and more, all in one place!": "الوصول إلى الوظائف الإضافية المميزة للمحاسبة والموارد البشرية والمدفوعات والعملاء المحتملين والاتصالات والإدارة والمزيد، كل ذلك في مكان واحد!",
